The tester's 58043: the never-opened line („… აპი ჯერ არ გაუხსნია …
მაინც გავუგზავნო?") came with no buttons, 2 of 2. The server's line now
carries its buttons with it: „მაინც გაუგზავნე" / „სხვა გზა ვეძებოთ" (the
founder's words relayed in box 58017), with en/ru/es beside them. They are
listed as server labels, so the button editor leaves them alone.

Owner-facing text (D44): DORMANT_CHOICES_ON is false until Misho's yes
word for word. While off, nothing changes.

